lur=200&s=510a1e13ce2cd6c652493f8c0b244d04 3x"}, "body": "こんにちはこんにちは！！私のオリジナルキャラクターのイラストを依頼したいです！彼女は全体的にリスをテーマにしており、性格はより前向きで明るいタイプです。性格はリスっぽいと表現できます。夢を追いかけ、主に盾を使って戦うことで、住む街をより安全にしたいと思っています。そのため、考えなしに喧嘩に巻き込まれることも多いです。 また、彼女は低予算のオフィス組織のリーダーでもあります。これは街の安全を守りたい小さな専門職団体ですが、予算が不足しています。URLには彼女をイメージする参考資料をいくつか載せています。自分で描いた落書きもいくつか含めました :D どうぞご自由に描いてください！本当にありがとうございます！！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XI0fHSA2W2noHnnOOFxymWJ50wT0SdxJ", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rurarurara4431/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3369520, "client_id": 3572105, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/152f4584/uploads/origins/f155cfef-5883-4589-b042-798f7ad783b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebde90650b285c7b4fd9622ca85d798b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/152f4584/uploads/origins/f155cfef-5883-4589-b042-798f7ad783b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebde90650b285c7b4fd9622ca85d798b, https://si.imgix.net/152f4584/uploads/origins/f155cfef-5883-4589-b042-798f7ad783b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6e9c93ac43cdc4e20bdeea5279306c8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/152f4584/uploads/origins/f155cfef-5883-4589-b042-798f7ad783b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8155380cb2873585b6802ce113a4f438 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/152f4584/uploads/origins/f155cfef-5883-4589-b042-798f7ad783b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=315aae46b5db3d34f386cdc33404ae13", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/152f4584/uploads/origins/f155cfef-5883-4589-b042-798f7ad783b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=315aae46b5db3d34f386cdc33404ae13, https://si.imgix.net/152f4584/uploads/origins/f155cfef-5883-4589-b042-798f7ad783b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b84198aaeedd65aa39b563961d1c2998 2x, https://si.imgix.net/152f4584/uploads/origins/f155cfef-5883-4589-b042-798f7ad783b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=08df17845e1db6f6a38d77abe4b3b40b 3x"}, "body": "If you do not believe you understand this request fully well to draw it with your heart, feel free to reject this.\n\nThis genre or feeling is a romantic tragedy.\n\nThe two characters are from the game called \"Limbus Company\"\nCharacter 1 - Yi Sang (Male)\nCharacter 2 - Ishmael (Female)\n\nYi Sang and Ishmael are in empowered forms (E.G.Os) which is why their uniforms are the way they are. Yi Sang is doing the attack called \"Fell Bullet\" Where he needs to shot and kill someone to use it at his full power. Ishmael, accepts his bullet. Her locket is on her hand opened and she's making a love sign with the other. Yi Sang is extremely distressed in not wanting to shoot her.\n\nThe gun Yi Sang is holding is called \"Lee–Enfield Mk I\"\nBehind Ishmael is the background of a war zone, but also mirror shards of loving memories with her and Yi Sang together.\nBehind Yi Sang is a radiant light of sorts accompanying him.\nBoth backgrounds merge in a way in the middle.\n\nThat's all, Thank you and take your time.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mjoEtMtQpEUofBoBjKwKyK3j1kryY9ud?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1325281, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "北川ロイ@SA1のマリーザ", "screen_name": "RoyKitagawa", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1982260548466020352/Vie4FtsF.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/131969